      "message": "fuzz: cover unconfirmed outputs and null coin control in spend target\n\nAdd wallet transactions in the mempool state with a fuzzed version, and\ncall AvailableCoins() directly with an optional null coin control, an\noptional fuzzed feerate and fuzzed filter params, including\nmin_sum_amount and max_count to reach the early-return paths.",
